Here is the complete, provider-agnostic Dual NAT Gateway + Auto-Failover setup. It requires zero cloud API calls, has no single point of failure, works with any external DBaaS (including dynamic DNS endpoints like AWS Aurora), and uses only standard Linux tools (iptables, iproute2, dig).

